     A                                  1 22'ADD AN ALTERNATE KEY'
     A                                  5  1'Type the alternate key and the ven-
     A                                      dor code for that alternate key.  T-
     A                                      he'
     A                                  6  1'vendor code must exist in the vend-
     A                                      or database.  The alternate key mus-
     A                                      t'
     A                                  7  1'not already exist.'
     A                                 10 18'ALTERNATE KEY    VENDOR CODE'
     A            ALTKEY        10A  B 11 18DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A                                      OVRATR
     A  01                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  01                                  DSPATR(PC)
     A            CODE          10A  B 11 35DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A                                      OVRATR
     A  02                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  02                                  DSPATR(PC)
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('f7-EXIT f3-END PROGRAM     -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
     A  99        MESSAGELN1    79   M
     A  99                                  OVRDTA
     A          R FALTDEL
     A*%%TS  SD  19950421  131920  A229282     REL-V3R1M0  5763-PW1
