     A                                  1 18'DELETE AN ALTERNATE KEY'
     A                                  4  9'Type the alternate key to delete a-
     A                                      nd press "enter":'
     A            ALTKEY        10A  B  6 10DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A                                      OVRATR
     A  01                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  01                                  DSPATR(PC)
     A            DUMMYCD       10A  B  9 10DSPATR(PR)
     A                                      OVRDTA
